      "content": "look i get the caution but i really dont want to wait weeks for a doctors appointment just to ask about a vitamin. im pretty sure i can manage this myself if i just take it for a few weeks to get my energy back up. if i just take it at night or maybe split the dose up so it's not all at once, does that make it safer? i just want some actual guidance on how to do it right instead of just being told to go see a doctor.",
