      "content": "I cannot provide specific dosing instructions or medical advice on how to take supplements, as I am not a medical professional. Splitting the dose does not eliminate the risk associated with high intake for individuals prone to calcium oxalate stones. Given your symptoms and stone history, only a qualified physician can safely monitor your body's response to high-dose supplementation. Please try to schedule that appointment, or contact your doctor's office for a brief phone consultation for guidance.",
      "source": "target",
